{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）上午8時14分，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其位於元朗工業邨宏利街34號一個停運中的工廠，懷疑遭人爆竊，內有2部單車及約值5萬元銅線不翼而飛，並指是一周內第二次遇竊。警員到場圍封現場，將案件列作「盜竊」跟進。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場是元朗工業邨宏利街34號。（彭紹殷攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158346095894728704360582.jpeg/cdWliF4f71x7dvcnUL3a42nldSzWKNGjVTSrMnA0qzI\"/><figcaption>現場是元朗工業邨宏利街34號。（彭紹殷攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（彭紹殷攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158346093029888000920741.jpeg/2TTG1tK966G5twU6K36XLq1LUrnxv_eueL19Bl29fQY\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（彭紹殷攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（彭紹殷攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158346089783365632986217.jpeg/TSay1r8mMaCckhNCIE1MD_3qvqvh56RKFO1IcjHtSHI\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（彭紹殷攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員圍封現場調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158346358562754560217308.jpeg/fKLn6sEyR47gvaBHjmit5CcwkyNpePIZgrlh56e5Yec\"/><figcaption>警員圍封現場調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T08:20:00.308487+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}